<view class="page result-page">
 <block wx:if="{{result}}">
  <view class="result-hero"><text class="result-icon">✦</text><text class="brand">这一次，你是</text><text class="result-title">{{result.title}}</text><text class="muted">{{seconds}} 秒发现 {{result.found.length}} 处小不同</text><view class="score-line"><text>{{result.score}}</text><text>分</text></view><view class="result-meta"><text>点错 {{result.misses}} 次</text><text>AI 帮忙 {{result.hints}} 次</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{result.match}}" class="match-card"><text class="small">你和朋友的这局默契</text><text class="match-title">{{result.match.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{result.match.percent !== null}}" class="match-percent">{{result.match.percent}}<text>%</text></text><text class="copy">{{result.match.detail}}</text><text class="tiny muted">按本局先找到的细节计算，只是游戏里的小默契。</text></view>
  <view wx:else class="match-card"><text class="match-title">谁和你第一眼就合拍？</text><text class="copy">邀请朋友玩同一关，看看你们会不会先发现同一个细节。</text><view wx:if="{{firstFinds.length}}" class="find-tags"><text wx:for="{{firstFinds}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><text class="tiny muted">朋友独立找完，再揭晓结果。</text></view>
  <button class="primary full mt" bindtap="invite">{{result.match?'再邀一位朋友，比比默契':'邀请朋友，测测默契'}}</button>
  <view class="ai-recap"><text>✦ 下一局建议</text><text class="small">{{result.advice}}</text><button class="link" bindtap="again">再玩一局 ›</button></view>
  <view class="gift-row"><view><text class="h3">品牌准备了一份小心意</text><text class="small muted">双人周末灵感卡 · 不用邀请也可领取</text></view><button class="gift-button" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">领小礼物</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error mt">{{error}}</view><text wx:if="{{isDemo}}" class="footer-note">演示结果不作为真实奖励或客户数据。</text>
 </block><view wx:else class="empty">还没开始这局挑战<button class="primary mt" bindtap="home">去玩一局</button></view>
</view>